ally concept art from  artist dean sheriff showed an even more  flowery version of the 838 manhattan but  includes wong with doctor strange in  america meaning this would have been a  version of the movie in which wong was  not left in 616 with wanda waldron also  explained to her friends at the house of  our ring reverse podcast mallory rubin  and joanna robertson that one version of  wong would have been a vegas magician  turned schwarzenegger action hero my  very first draft had instead of wanda  throwing wong off the side of the  mountain she rewrites him but instead of  rewriting him sitcom style she rewrites  him into an 80s style action hero like  like arnold schwarzenegger and commando  and then she  she like uses she like takes him into  the dream walk and he possesses his 838  self when this version became  disillusioned with commerce and is just  a disgruntled vegas  magician so we called him vegas wong so  it was like him there was like a scene  of him performing magic on stage and  then going back smoking a cigarette and  then he gets possessed and basically  becomes this arnold schwarzenegger wong  he was with wanda  in the assault on the illuminati you may  have also seen in sheriff's concept art  a busker in 838 kind of like a bert from  mary poppins with a bunch of instruments  strapped to him i assume this is what  turned into the comedic cameo by bruce  campbell as the vendor pizza papa but at  one point there was a character named  melvin strange magician of strange  without any magic that might be why  pizza popping the scene accused 616  strange of stealing the strange wardrobe  from the strange museum by the way there  were a few alternate takes of bruce  campbell as pizza papa including one  from the post-credits scene ah  it's over  doctor strange  has not seen the last  of the pizza papa there were also a few  things removed from the multiverse  montage the frame store artists behind  this revealed that they removed a  universe based on the art of james  tyrell and in the cube world we actually  had to make the cubes that strange in  america divide into much larger and only  slowly separating from their face  because originally they went way too  small with the cubes showing more of the  bloody chunks of flesh on the other side  of the skin from the inside it just  basically looked like their bodies  exploding in the blood and it was  terrifying they also released the  deleted footage of strange and christine  from their past as surgeons doing an  interview for whih that of course is the  in-universe mcu news network about the  strange palmer method of removing part  of the spinal column to allow paralyzed  patients to walk again this actually  reads something more from the era of the  2016 film but might have been part of  the flashback of the memory lane bank in  838 when strange revisits his dinner  date with christine when she gave him  the watch waldron also detailed an  alternate ending or at least an ending  that more fully explains what happens in  the theatrical cuts ending waldron said  that the original plan was to answer the  question posed by this exchange how are  you feeling  why do you ask  you use the dark coded dreamwalk into  your own cards oh  yeah right there  fine  of course the theatrical indeed shows  strange's third eye opening as he  screams and then we cut to black but  according to waldron the original plan  was to show our 616 strange trapped in  the post-incursion universe and then  back at 616 who we thought was 616  strange turns around and that third eye  opens revealing him to be sinister  strange swapped places with our strange  followed by the laugh of the horror icon  vincent price echoing the final moment  of michael jackson's thriller so yes  sinister strange and 616 strange swapped  places and this is being reported as an  alternate ending but really i just think  it's an alternate sillier version of how  we are meant to interpret the ending  that we saw in the 